WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- I love this suit.

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.513
- Thank you so much.

00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:03.540
- [Kelly] Oh my God, with your red hair.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.700
I'm in love with all of you.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.060
- Thank you.
- I would introduce you,

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.065
but I hear y'all have made
out before, so yes, yes.

00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:10.898
- On a TV show.

00:00:10.898 --> 00:00:13.410
- Yeah, yeah, on a TV show.
- [Kelly] On a TV show.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.243
- On his TV show.

00:00:14.243 --> 00:00:15.300
- Just backstage, it was weird,

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.370
we were like, "Guys, get a room."

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:20.150
No, but how, do you remember the kiss,

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.050
either one of you?

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.117
- [Both] Yeah.

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:24.570
(audience laughs)

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.760
- Yeah, it was this show,
I had a sketch show,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.320
and Jane was on it,

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.410
it was a very silly sketch
called "Madison Chooses"

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.810
and she was great, and
I played two characters,

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:34.930
the bad boy and the sweet guy.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.480
And we had, I don't know, it was fun.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.428
- Yeah.
(laughter)

00:00:39.428 --> 00:00:40.718
- You've got her number.

00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:42.300
- No I totally remember,
I actually remember,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.230
after you made fun of it.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.890
(clapping and laughter)

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:47.710
And then I remember,

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:48.763
people have asked me.
- Made fun of the kiss?

00:00:48.763 --> 00:00:50.890
- Well yeah, I mean it was
awkward, it's like awkward.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:54.430
People often ask, "Is
it weird to be an actor

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:57.830
and have to kiss people on sets?"

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.030
And I also, I remembered this,

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:00.790
but then I was thinking about this story,

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.640
I remembered making a movie in 2011,

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.830
I had to kiss my costar.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.780
And another costar came
up to me after the kiss,

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.600
and was like, "I found a raccoon
trapped in a trashcan once,

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.722
and that's how you guys sounded
when you were making out."

00:01:12.722 --> 00:01:14.522
(audience laughs)
And I was like...

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:19.015
- Oh my god, way to just
instill the confidence.

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:22.357
- Yeah, I was like, "Thanks."

